                "loc": "GEN.9.8+GEN.9.9+GEN.9.10+GEN.9.11+GEN.9.12+GEN.9.13+GEN.9.14+GEN.9.15+GEN.9.16+GEN.9.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tha 9:8-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum maeni en e calu pi pa Noa ira; kum calu akwong’o nia pi pa Noa biumo ng’om kendo ngo, e akwong’o nia kwinyo binega kendo ngo i kumi kumeca, kadi ajuka de abijuki ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum gudi copo ai, man jucopo kabu ungulu gudi; ento mer mi bero para biai kud i beng’i ngo, kadok lembariba para mi kwiocwiny de jubikabu ngo, Yehova ma kisa nege i kumi wacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
