            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.18+REV.21.19+REV.21.20+REV.21.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 21:18-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E in ma jusendi, ma juting’i ku wavuvu, ma jujuki ngo, nen, abiketho kitpiny ma ber kum kidi peri, man abiketho thepiny peri ku kidi ma tek ma ie nen uluga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abitimo usimbru udi peri ku kidi ma kwar, man dhugang’ peri ku kidi ma kwar ma tek, man jambruko peri ceke ku kidi ma pire tek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.6.45"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 6:45",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova biponjo nyithindho peri ceke; man kwiocwiny mi nyithindho peri bibedo dit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jubiketho icungo i bedopwe: ibibedo bor ku masendi, kum lworo binegi ngo; man ni ndiri, kum ebibino ceng’ni i vuti ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, gicopo cokri karacelo, ento ni kuma ngo: dhanu ma tek bicokri karacelo i kumi bipodho ni kumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, acwio won uka ma kudho mac mi cukmac, man ma thiedho jamtic mi tic pare; man acwio janyoth kara unyothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jambali moko mbe ma jucwio i kumi ma bibedo miero; man ibigonjo leb ceke kubang’e kubang’e ma biai i kumi i pokolembe. Maeni en e aba mi jutic pa Yehova, man bedopwe migi m’uai i bang’a, Yehova wacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
